489 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 272 0 R
/T (CampusConnect improves information visibility by making events discoverable through a consistent interface and improves operational control by separating student, organizer, and administrator capabilities. From a database engineering perspective, it also demonstrates how integrity constraints and transaction boundaries can be used to make business rules enforceable rather than merely advisory. The repository therefore serves both as a usable campus application and as evidence for the course concepts required by 25CS1302E.)
/E (CampusConnect improves information visibility by making events discoverable through a consistent interface and improves operational control by separating student, organizer, and administrator capabilities. From a database engineering perspective, it also demonstrates how integrity constraints and transaction boundaries can be used to make business rules enforceable rather than merely advisory. The repository therefore serves both as a usable campus application and as evidence for the course concepts required by 25CS1302E.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
