/T (The backend is a modular Spring MVC application in the `com.tejaswin.campus` package. Controllers expose browser and JSON endpoints; services encapsulate event lifecycle, registration, recommendations, sessions, security checks, and telemetry; repositories provide JPA access. `EventService` is the primary business service, while dedicated controllers expose administrator, organizer, authentication, event, and telemetry behavior.)
/E (The backend is a modular Spring MVC application in the `com.tejaswin.campus` package. Controllers expose browser and JSON endpoints; services encapsulate event lifecycle, registration, recommendations, sessions, security checks, and telemetry; repositories provide JPA access. `EventService` is the primary business service, while dedicated controllers expose administrator, organizer, authentication, event, and telemetry behavior.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
