<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 276 0 R
/T (The Dockerfile builds the React frontend with Node 20 and pnpm, packages it into the Spring Boot static resources, then produces a non-root Java 21 runtime image. Docker Compose provisions a MySQL service and the application service, waits for database health before starting the application, and persists MySQL data and uploaded media in named volumes. The application port is configurable through the `PORT` environment variable and defaults to 8080 in the current configuration.)
/E (The Dockerfile builds the React frontend with Node 20 and pnpm, packages it into the Spring Boot static resources, then produces a non-root Java 21 runtime image. Docker Compose provisions a MySQL service and the application service, waits for database health before starting the application, and persists MySQL data and uploaded media in named volumes. The application port is configurable through the `PORT` environment variable and defaults to 8080 in the current configuration.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
