<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 280 0 R
/T (The React frontend uses Vite for development and production bundling and organizes server state around React Query. Forms are validated with React Hook Form and Zod. The application consumes the Spring JSON API and SSE streams rather than connecting directly to MySQL. The build is code-split using Vite manual chunks for React, motion, query, icons, and forms. The retained Thymeleaf templates support legacy server-rendered flows that coexist with the React SPA delivery model.)
/E (The React frontend uses Vite for development and production bundling and organizes server state around React Query. Forms are validated with React Hook Form and Zod. The application consumes the Spring JSON API and SSE streams rather than connecting directly to MySQL. The build is code-split using Vite manual chunks for React, motion, query, icons, and forms. The retained Thymeleaf templates support legacy server-rendered flows that coexist with the React SPA delivery model.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
