726 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 280 0 R
/T (The backend exposes REST endpoints under `/api/...` and also serves web-facing routes. `EventApiController` provides event listing, details, and registration flows, while `OrganizerController` provides club-scoped organizer capabilities. `EventTelemetryController` exposes `text/event-stream` endpoints for capacity and live check-in updates. OpenAPI documents are generated through springdoc and are available at `/v3/api-docs` with Swagger UI under `/swagger-ui.html`.)
/E (The backend exposes REST endpoints under `/api/...` and also serves web-facing routes. `EventApiController` provides event listing, details, and registration flows, while `OrganizerController` provides club-scoped organizer capabilities. `EventTelemetryController` exposes `text/event-stream` endpoints for capacity and live check-in updates. OpenAPI documents are generated through springdoc and are available at `/v3/api-docs` with Swagger UI under `/swagger-ui.html`.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
727 0 obj
