728 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 280 0 R
/T (Authorization is configured in `SecurityConfig.java`. Public event discovery and authentication endpoints are explicitly permitted; `/admin/**` and `/api/admin/**` require `ROLE_ADMIN`; `/api/organizer/**` requires `ROLE_ORGANIZER` or `ROLE_ADMIN`. Event-specific organizer operations additionally use the application-level expression `@securityService.canManageEvent\(principal, #id\)`. Session fixation protection, CSRF handling, CSP/referrer headers, and login rate limiting are also configured in the security layer.)
/E (Authorization is configured in `SecurityConfig.java`. Public event discovery and authentication endpoints are explicitly permitted; `/admin/**` and `/api/admin/**` require `ROLE_ADMIN`; `/api/organizer/**` requires `ROLE_ORGANIZER` or `ROLE_ADMIN`. Event-specific organizer operations additionally use the application-level expression `@securityService.canManageEvent\(principal, #id\)`. Session fixation protection, CSRF handling, CSP/referrer headers, and login rate limiting are also configured in the security layer.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
