/T (The frontend tree contains 89 TypeScript/TSX source files and 19 test/spec files. The CI workflow runs Vitest with coverage, then launches Playwright against Chromium and exercises Axe accessibility checks before the production build is produced. This is stronger than manual browser verification alone because the pipeline performs repeatable automated checks on the client bundle.)
/E (The frontend tree contains 89 TypeScript/TSX source files and 19 test/spec files. The CI workflow runs Vitest with coverage, then launches Playwright against Chromium and exercises Axe accessibility checks before the production build is produced. This is stronger than manual browser verification alone because the pipeline performs repeatable automated checks on the client bundle.)
