/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 283 0 R
/T (The repository documentation records a 10-thread duplicate-registration stress test in which one registration succeeds and nine are rejected by the unique user-event constraint, as well as a distinct-user test in which eight simultaneous registrations succeed without deadlocks. The implementation uses pessimistic event-row locking through `findByIdForUpdate` plus the database unique constraint on `\(user_id, event_id\)`.)
/E (The repository documentation records a 10-thread duplicate-registration stress test in which one registration succeeds and nine are rejected by the unique user-event constraint, as well as a distinct-user test in which eight simultaneous registrations succeed without deadlocks. The implementation uses pessimistic event-row locking through `findByIdForUpdate` plus the database unique constraint on `\(user_id, event_id\)`.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
