<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 283 0 R
/T (Query optimization documentation records a before/after experiment for category-filtered event queries: a full scan and filesort are replaced by the composite `\(category, date_time\)` B-tree index, with a documented cost reduction from 1.45 to 0.70 and filesort elimination. Because this benchmark is repository documentation rather than a fresh measurement performed during this report generation, it is reported as documented evidence rather than re-measured evidence.)
/E (Query optimization documentation records a before/after experiment for category-filtered event queries: a full scan and filesort are replaced by the composite `\(category, date_time\)` B-tree index, with a documented cost reduction from 1.45 to 0.70 and filesort elimination. Because this benchmark is repository documentation rather than a fresh measurement performed during this report generation, it is reported as documented evidence rather than re-measured evidence.)
