/T (The multi-stage Dockerfile is designed so that the final runtime contains only the Java application and runtime dependencies, not the full Node or Maven toolchains. The final container runs as UID 10001, exposes the configured port, creates an uploads directory, and checks `/actuator/health` as a container healthcheck. Docker Compose provides the MySQL service, network wiring, health-gated dependency startup, and persistent volumes for database data and uploads.)
/E (The multi-stage Dockerfile is designed so that the final runtime contains only the Java application and runtime dependencies, not the full Node or Maven toolchains. The final container runs as UID 10001, exposes the configured port, creates an uploads directory, and checks `/actuator/health` as a container healthcheck. Docker Compose provides the MySQL service, network wiring, health-gated dependency startup, and persistent volumes for database data and uploads.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
