928 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 285 0 R
/T (The repository contains `firebase.json` and `.firebaserc` configuration for Firebase Hosting. The hosting target is configured to serve `frontend-redesign/dist` with a catch-all rewrite to `index.html`, making it suitable for SPA routing. Firestore rules and indexes are also present, but the primary CampusConnect relational runtime remains the Spring/MySQL system. The Firebase configuration should therefore be treated as an auxiliary hosting/integration layer rather than as a replacement for the core database.)
/E (The repository contains `firebase.json` and `.firebaserc` configuration for Firebase Hosting. The hosting target is configured to serve `frontend-redesign/dist` with a catch-all rewrite to `index.html`, making it suitable for SPA routing. Firestore rules and indexes are also present, but the primary CampusConnect relational runtime remains the Spring/MySQL system. The Firebase configuration should therefore be treated as an auxiliary hosting/integration layer rather than as a replacement for the core database.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [16]
>>
