/T (The repository contains conflicting version statements. `pom.xml` declares Spring Boot 4.1.0 and a Java 21 build target, while the CI workflow uses JDK 21. The README and some earlier design documents mention Java 25 and MySQL 8.4, and `docs/design-report.md` contains a Spring Boot 3.4.1 statement. The current build file and CI workflow are the most reliable indicators of what the automated pipeline actually executes. Future documentation maintenance should align all version claims with these authoritative configuration files.)
/E (The repository contains conflicting version statements. `pom.xml` declares Spring Boot 4.1.0 and a Java 21 build target, while the CI workflow uses JDK 21. The README and some earlier design documents mention Java 25 and MySQL 8.4, and `docs/design-report.md` contains a Spring Boot 3.4.1 statement. The current build file and CI workflow are the most reliable indicators of what the automated pipeline actually executes. Future documentation maintenance should align all version claims with these authoritative configuration files.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
