/E (`RateLimitingFilter` stores Bucket4j buckets in a Caffeine in-memory cache. This is simple and effective for a single application instance, but limits are not automatically shared between multiple nodes. The code comment itself identifies a future Redis/distributed Bucket4j approach for multi-instance deployments.)
