<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 288 0 R
/T (CampusConnect is a database-centered university event platform that combines a modern React frontend with a Spring Boot application and MySQL relational database. Its architecture separates presentation, security, business services, persistence, and operational concerns while keeping the system deployable as a modular monolith. The platform provides student discovery, administrative event management, organizer workspaces, attendance check-in, recommendations, live telemetry, and a transactional outbox primitive for reliable asynchronous event propagation.)
/E (CampusConnect is a database-centered university event platform that combines a modern React frontend with a Spring Boot application and MySQL relational database. Its architecture separates presentation, security, business services, persistence, and operational concerns while keeping the system deployable as a modular monolith. The platform provides student discovery, administrative event management, organizer workspaces, attendance check-in, recommendations, live telemetry, and a transactional outbox primitive for reliable asynchronous event propagation.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
