2017 0 obj
<<
/Title (The platform supports event search and category filtering, event detail views, role-based administration, club- scoped organizer workspaces, event creation and lifecycle management, external registration redirection, attendance check-in, CSV export, explainable event recommendations, and real-time Server-Sent Events \(SSE\) for capacity and organizer check-in telemetry. Database integrity is enforced through primary keys, foreign keys, unique constraints, CHECK constraints, indexes, and Flyway migrations. Registration workflows use a database uniqueness invariant on \(user_id, event_id\), while service-level pessimistic locking is used for concurrency-sensitive operations.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1988 0 R
/Prev 2004 0 R
/Next 2005 0 R
>>
