/Title (Authorization is configured in `SecurityConfig.java`. Public event discovery and authentication endpoints are explicitly permitted; `/admin/**` and `/api/admin/**` require `ROLE_ADMIN`; `/api/organizer/**` requires `ROLE_ORGANIZER` or `ROLE_ADMIN`. Event-specific organizer operations additionally use the application-level expression `@securityService.canManageEvent\(principal, #id\)`. Session fixation protection, CSRF handling, CSP/referrer headers, and login rate limiting are also configured in the security layer.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2167 0 R
/First 2235 0 R
