/Title (The modern frontend is located under `frontend-redesign/` and is a React 19 application built with Vite and TypeScript. The dependency set includes Tailwind CSS, React Query for server state, React Hook Form and Zod for forms and validation, Motion for UI transitions, and Lucide icons. Vite is configured to split major vendor packages into separate chunks. The frontend CI gate runs formatting/lint checks through Biome, strict TypeScript compilation, Vitest tests with coverage, Playwright browser tests, and Axe accessibility checks before building production assets.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2224 0 R
/Next 2257 0 R
>>
endobj
