<<
/Title (The backend is a modular Spring MVC application in the `com.tejaswin.campus` package. Controllers expose browser and JSON endpoints; services encapsulate event lifecycle, registration, recommendations, sessions, security checks, and telemetry; repositories provide JPA access. `EventService` is the primary business service, while dedicated controllers expose administrator, organizer, authentication, event, and telemetry behavior.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2258 0 R
>>
endobj
