<<
/Title (Git and GitHub are used as the source-control system. The current workflow file is named `Production Delivery Pipeline`, but its present jobs are verification and security gates rather than an end-to-end production deployment. The frontend gate uses Node 20 and pnpm 9; the backend gate uses JDK 21 and a MySQL 8.0 service; the security gate runs Gitleaks and Trivy. A separate Firebase Hosting configuration is present in the repository for the frontend build.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2259 0 R
>>
endobj
